{"3280080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Malware Tycoon", "steam_appid": 3280080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy All Technology?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2002. Upon visiting your local dump scavenging for car parts, you came across an abandoned PC. &quot;Weird&quot;, you thought, &quot;It looks pretty modern. Who would throw something like this out?&quot;. Upon hooking it up, you realize this computer belonged to a former NSA agent and has tools on it to make and distribute malware. With these programs, you could make money, you could mess with your friends, you could destroy computers... you could destroy ALL computers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Malicious Thoughts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this newfound goal in mind, you get to work. You visit Grewgle. You spread your malware to unsuspecting users on forums. You make your malware spreadable to the point where thousands of computers can be infected in mere weeks. You begin to learn more and more about malware development to the point where those thousands turn into hundreds of thousands, or even millions. What can the antivirus companies do about it? How far can you take this before you get caught? Your decisions will form the answers to these questions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Scenarios</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many things you can do with these programs so graciously provided by the NSA. Maybe you can become a millionaire. Maybe you'll destroy all technology. Maybe you're just in it to see how many computers you can infect before getting caught. Malware Tycoon supports all of these goals, and so much more. Simply pick a scenario, and get to work on your goals, whatever those might be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malware Tycoon requires a sharp mind, and quick decision-making skills. Learning how to create the perfect malware takes time and money. Want to procrastinate? Waste time? You won't get far no matter what your goal is. Keep an eye on your bank account, grow your cash flow, continuously learn, and stay one step ahead of the game. You're not the only malware dev out there either - you really can't trust anyone on the World Wide Web. Find your way into destruction, wealth, and infections before someone else does it for you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy All Technology?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2002. Upon visiting your local dump scavenging for car parts, you came across an abandoned PC. &quot;Weird&quot;, you thought, &quot;It looks pretty modern. Who would throw something like this out?&quot;. Upon hooking it up, you realize this computer belonged to a former NSA agent and has tools on it to make and distribute malware. With these programs, you could make money, you could mess with your friends, you could destroy computers... you could destroy ALL computers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Malicious Thoughts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this newfound goal in mind, you get to work. You visit Grewgle. You spread your malware to unsuspecting users on forums. You make your malware spreadable to the point where thousands of computers can be infected in mere weeks. You begin to learn more and more about malware development to the point where those thousands turn into hundreds of thousands, or even millions. What can the antivirus companies do about it? How far can you take this before you get caught? Your decisions will form the answers to these questions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Scenarios</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many things you can do with these programs so graciously provided by the NSA. Maybe you can become a millionaire. Maybe you'll destroy all technology. Maybe you're just in it to see how many computers you can infect before getting caught. Malware Tycoon supports all of these goals, and so much more. Simply pick a scenario, and get to work on your goals, whatever those might be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malware Tycoon requires a sharp mind, and quick decision-making skills. Learning how to create the perfect malware takes time and money. Want to procrastinate? Waste time? You won't get far no matter what your goal is. Keep an eye on your bank account, grow your cash flow, continuously learn, and stay one step ahead of the game. You're not the only malware dev out there either - you really can't trust anyone on the World Wide Web. Find your way into destruction, wealth, and infections before someone else does it for you.</p>", "short_description": "Step back to the era of dial-up and WinGoals SP. As a black-hat developer, manage the delicate balance of detection probability versus payout potential. Will you build a silent botnet for profit or a worm designed to destroy? Avoid the feds and conquer the web in this nostalgic management sim.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280080/75f85d6b08025bc1e853ef9f1244ec30d588dd9e/header.jpg?t=1784282095", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280080/f8e3b4fabc36fbda1497e052e059ca4c80a18ef2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784282095", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280080/f8e3b4fabc36fbda1497e052e059ca4c80a18ef2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784282095", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 21H1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-6700k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This game should run on almost any modern hardware configuration without issues.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux Mint 22 / Ubuntu 24.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-6700k<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This game should run on almost any modern hardware configuration without issues. It should run on many/all modern Linux configurations without issue. The game was specifically tested on Linux Mint 22.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["JIMMY DIAMOND"], "publishers": ["JIMMY DIAMOND"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1162013], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Malware Tycoon", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1162013, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Malware Tycoon - $9.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 999}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "descriptio